<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (A real-time puzzle game controlled entirely by hand gestures, where players use a live camera to capture a photo, slice it into pieces, and reassemble it using hand gesture.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
372 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (PORTFOLIO)
/Pg 15 0 R
